# Kasir API Configuration

This file contains all environment variables for the Kasir API application.

## Database Configuration
- `DB_DRIVER`: Database driver type (currently sqlite)
- `DB_PATH`: Path to SQLite database file

## Server Configuration
- `PORT`: Server port (default: 8080)
- `GIN_MODE`: Gin framework mode (debug, release, test)

## API Configuration
- `API_VERSION`: API version (default: v1)
- `API_TITLE`: API title for documentation
- `API_DESCRIPTION`: API description for documentation

## Swagger Configuration
- `SWAGGER_HOST`: Swagger host (for documentation)
- `SWAGGER_BASEPATH`: Base path for Swagger
- `SWAGGER_SCHEMES`: HTTP schemes used by API
